      effectHtml: 'Builds a symbolic association that accumulates meaning across the scene or play rather than being confined to one line.',
      whyAuthorsUseItHtml: 'Allows Shakespeare to develop abstract ideas (imprisonment, mortality) through concrete, memorable images that recur and deepen.',
