      howToRecogniseHtml: 'A comparison that continues or is referenced again later, rather than appearing once and being abandoned.',
      commonMistakeHtml: 'Naming a metaphor without tracing how it develops or recurs — an "extended" metaphor needs evidence of its extension, not just its first appearance.',
